      "notes": [
        "1. Item 1 is cut and engraved from the KC-01-1051 production file of the same revision.",
        "2. Items 2, 4, 6 and 8 are complete modules to their own drawing packages; their button labels are in Documents/Labels/B2.",
        "3. The Panel Hub mounts behind the Wide Button Module (KC-01-1810). Slots: P1 empty, P2 Pre-Warp Time, P3 Time Control, P4 Vehicle Control, P5 empty, P6 Stability Control, P7 AUX CTRL, P8 Rotation.",
        "4. STAGE (item 10) and its arming switch (under item 11) go to the Panel Hub safe-switch terminal; MODE (item 9) goes to Time Control terminal CN2 (Hardware Reference §4.5).",
        "5. Sheets 1 and 2 at 2:5, sheet 3 at 1:5, on A3. Parts list on sheet 3."
      ]
